    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but lets get a bit more specific. when looking at these regions, is there a general rule of thumb comparing highly fragmented ethnic landscapes versus more homogenous ones? like, is high ethnic diversity almost always a red flag for civil unrest or corruption in these types of markets?",
